  "semantics": [
    "5C05/5C06 are signed unit/value WORD absolute HP/MP;5C82 is signed target/source/raw-effect WORD. Raw effect is not damage or a MISS result.",
    "AttackChar distance<3 sets opposing16px-per-tile offsets; horizontal facing assignment wins. Both actor counters reset0, source280=target and target280=-1; source294 receives raw flag, target294 is preserved.",
    "Connected attack counter increments to48 and clears on49. Numeric counter displays delta/MISS1..13, HP interpolation/readout1..26, clears on27. HP/MP/MISS share one slot per unit.",
    "HP delta row0 for negative, row1 for zero/positive; MP row3. Absolute HP interpolates old->new during11..20; color boundaries below30%, above70%.",
    "CounterMilliseconds40 is the existing configurable Unity presentation mapping; no original wall-clock/frame rate measurement, wire framing/socket or operating damage/cost rule is claimed."
  ]
